{"chars": "Lanterns glow amber between the shelves. Thin copper pipes run along the walls, carrying melted snow, and the water inside them chimes softly as it flows, tink, tink, tinkle, like faraway bells. The books lean together on the shelves as if whispering stories to one another. In the middle of the room stands a long oak table, smooth and shiny from hundreds of years of elbows, and beside it a squashy armchair with a patchwork quilt. The whole room smells of ink, beeswax candles and old paper, with a hint of cinnamon drifting up from the kitchen far below.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 1.087, 1.087, 1.087, 1.087, 1.087, 1.087, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.712, 1.712, 1.712, 1.712, 1.812, 1.812, 1.812, 1.812, 1.812, 1.812, 1.812, 1.812, 2.675, 2.788, 2.788, 2.788, 2.788, 2.788, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.65, 3.65, 3.65, 3.65, 3.85, 3.85, 3.85, 3.85, 3.85, 3.85, 4.138, 4.138, 4.138, 4.138, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.8, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 6.4, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.612, 6.612, 6.612, 6.612, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.6, 8.6, 8.6, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 9.275, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.85, 9.963, 9.963, 9.963, 9.963, 9.963, 10.4, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.9, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.7, 11.7, 11.7, 11.7, 11.7, 11.7, 12.5, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.7, 12.7, 12.7, 12.7, 12.7, 12.7, 12.975, 12.975, 12.975, 12.975, 12.975, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.2, 13.537, 13.537, 13.537, 13.63